{"availability":"available","full":"FrigadeHQ/yap","name":"yap","description":"Free, open source voice dictation for macOS. On-device transcription with Apple's Speech framework. No cloud/no API keys/no account.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Swift","stars":444,"forks":33,"created":"2026-07-23T23:34:40Z","updated":"2026-09-24T00:31:24Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://frigade.com/yap","topics":["accessibility","apple-speech","dictation","macos","macos-app","menubar","offline","on-device","privacy","speech-recognition","speech-to-text","swift","swiftui","transcription","voice-to-text","wispr-flow"],"demo":"https://demo.frigade.com/?utm_source=yap&utm_medium=readme","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T16:12:46.258Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T16:12:46.258Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T16:12:46.258Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:25.566Z","stars":442,"forks":34},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:12:46.258Z","stars":444,"forks":33}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Blazing-fast voice dictation for macOS that works anywhere you can type.","Press a shortcut, talk, press it again. Your words land in whatever text field you were using. No account, no API key, no audio leaving your machine.","There's no shortage of voice to text tools for macOS, and some of the open source ones are genuinely good. Most of them still run into some mix of the same problems:"],"features":["Some cost money, which is a lot to ask for something that's now built into your OS for free.","Most make you download a heavy model. Whisper weights run to hundreds of megabytes, sit in your RAM, and only feel fast on a recent, high end Mac. On slower machines a single paragraph can take thirty seconds to a…","A lot are Electron or web-stack apps, so a whole browser engine idles in your memory just to run a menu bar icon and a settings window.","Plenty are bloated with settings and modes you will never open.","Some are closed source, so you are trusting that your audio and transcripts stay on your machine, with no way to check."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FrigadeHQ/yap/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"566ca11a77e315cc244a897346ff12abb32c7d4bd9990efcfbc78ca9861b0c32","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:02:03.278Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:16:55.760Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Blazing-fast voice dictation for macOS that works anywhere you can type.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FrigadeHQ/yap/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No account, no API key, no audio leaving your machine.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FrigadeHQ/yap/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The app carries no model of its own, loads nothing into memory before the first word, and needs no API key or per minute cost.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FrigadeHQ/yap/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"The app carries no model of its own, loads nothing into memory before the first word, and needs no API key or per minute cost.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FrigadeHQ/yap/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"optional","text":"Optional launch at login, off by default","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FrigadeHQ/yap/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"566ca11a77e315cc244a897346ff12abb32c7d4bd9990efcfbc78ca9861b0c32","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FrigadeHQ/yap/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:16:55.761Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-24T00:31:24Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:16:55.763Z","overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T10:48:51.916Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/FrigadeHQ/yap/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T14:27:24.084Z","hash":"566ca11a77e315cc244a897346ff12abb32c7d4bd9990efcfbc78ca9861b0c32","originalBytes":11261,"storedBytes":11261,"truncated